{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"(like, MY level of stuttering)\n'Only thing. Wrong. Is my. Internal struggle. With words.' she's stuttering an insane amount.","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:03:04.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877975975613321216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"\"Hm, perhaps the sign language would be a neat thing to learn.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:08:18.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877977293564309534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"'In theory. In practise. It probably wouldn't help. Since I could just.'\nshe prestidigitates, extremely slowly, one word at a time, 'Do. This. But. Words don't. Work.'","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:09:11.505000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877977514562158642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"\"When one approach doesn't work, try a different one, perhaps? Like, have you ever heard my bugs talk back to me?\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:10:52.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877977939495506050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"'No, but I figured they had some kind of telepathy with you, like Kukudh and I...' her stuttering noticeably slows as she gets sidetracked.","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:11:38.401000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877978130688643143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"\"Oh, no telepathy at all. They are just bugs. There is some mind that emerges from them and myself combined, but overall they just buzz and skitter and do bug stuff. You just learn to interpret those even when they don't form words. ...or maybe it's all my imagination. Some people suggest that might be the case.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:13:59.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877978720646889583","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850785628467363840","content":"'Even if it is your imagination, it's fascinating how you manage to interpret things from them. It really is.' she trails off, gazing at him, before realising she's gotten herself distracted again. '...I'm... not good at this seizing the day thing, am I...'","created_at":"2021-08-19T18:17:22.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877979575810924554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
